      <h1>Compare has moved</h1>
      <p class="bhero-sub">Compare is now a tab of the Research desk, beside Ask, Power Search and the rest. This link still works, it just takes a moment longer.</p>
      <p class="bhero-sub"><a href="/the-faith-received/research/#compare" data-cmp-forward>Open Compare on the Research desk</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
<script src="{{asset "js/page/faith-tfr-rail.js"}}" defer></script>

{{> "faith-received/_beta-band"}}
